"<p>Security is the cornerstone of Nitrobase. All sensitive information—including SSH private keys, database passwords, environment variables, API tokens, and backup destination credentials—is encrypted at rest.</p>\n<h2>Encryption v2 Specification</h2>\n<p>Nitrobase uses <strong>Versioned Encryption (Format v2)</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Algorithm:</strong> AES-256-CBC.</li>\n<li><strong>Key Derivation:</strong> HKDF (HMAC-based Extract-and-Expand Key Derivation Function) with SHA-256.</li>\n<li><strong>Payload Structure:</strong> <code>v2:&#x3C;salt>:&#x3C;iv>:&#x3C;ciphertext></code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Concept of Nitrobase v2 Encryption</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> derivedKey</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> hkdf</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(masterEncryptionKey, salt, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"nitrobase-v2-encryption\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cipher</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> crypto.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createCipheriv</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"aes-256-cbc\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, derivedKey, iv);</span></span></code></pre>\n<h2>Key Rotation</h2>\n<p>If your master encryption key is ever compromised, Nitrobase provides an atomic key rotation script:</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> docker-compose.prod.yml</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --rm</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -e</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> OLD_ENCRYPTION_KEY='old-32-byte-hex-key'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -e</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ENCRYPTION_KEY='new-32-byte-hex-key'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  app</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bun</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> scripts/rotate-encryption-key.ts</span></span></code></pre>"